  "roles": {
    "formalizer": "root-samplinglib-writer",
    "blind_decoder": "Independent packet-only mathematical decoder. Inherited generic ASTIS project instructions, memory summary, skill catalog and environment context were visible, including generic project/source names. No packet-specific original source text, title, theorem anchor, proof, source identity, semantic review, repair, project mathematical files or compiler was accessed. This records the limited packet-only input boundary and does not claim completely context-free fresh source blindness.",
